Nebula catalogues added to the OpenNGC data, each via VizieR (CDS):
  Sharpless HII regions (Sh2): Sharpless 1959, ApJS 4, 257, VizieR VII/20.
  Lynds' Catalogue of Dark Nebulae (LDN): Lynds 1962, ApJS 7, 1, VizieR VII/7A.
  Barnard's Catalogue of 349 Dark Objects in the Sky (B): Barnard 1927,
    VizieR VII/220A.
  van den Bergh reflection nebulae (vdB): van den Bergh 1966, AJ 71, 990,
    VizieR VII/21.
  Lynds' Catalogue of Bright Nebulae (LBN): Lynds 1965, ApJS 12, 163, via
    VizieR VII/9 (CDS).
This research has made use of the VizieR catalogue access tool, CDS,
Strasbourg, France (DOI: 10.26093/cds/vizier).

Gaia DR3 photometry is queried live from Nocturne's own copy of the subset it
uses (https://gaia.nocturneastro.com, built from the ESA Gaia archive), and from
CDS/VizieR (catalogue I/355, https://vizier.cds.unistra.fr) when that copy does
not answer. Gaia data (c) ESA/Gaia/DPAC, CC BY-NC 3.0 IGO
